# mm.sketch

The sketch module providing a sketch programming model above mm.mcu and mm.stdio: run(), requestExit(), dispatch(), GPIO pinMode/digitalWrite/digitalRead, built-in LED overloads and ledOn/ledOff, delay/millis, the error latch, and Serial.
